      *================================================================*
      * DFHAID — CICS Attention Identifier (AID) definitions.
      *
      * Canonical source: IBM CICS standard DFHAID copybook. The AID key
      * names match this project's NacaTransRules.xml "keyPressed" category
      * (CLEAR/ENTER/PF1..PF24 -> DFHCLEAR/DFHENTER/DFHPF1..DFHPF24); the
      * single-byte AID values are the IBM CICS standard attention keys.
      *
      * NOTE: this project marks DFHAID as an ignoredCopy (NacaTransRules),
      * i.e. COPY DFHAID is satisfied by the runtime rather than literally
      * included; this copybook exists as the canonical, non-empty definition.
      *================================================================*
